        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DHK7, Extra Long 7 Inch Heavy Duty Kickdown Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7\" Kickdown Door Stop is perfect for use where an extra long door stop is needed, such as on storefront doors where there is a tall threshold. When not in use, it flips up and out of the way. This extra long kickdown door holder is made of solid brass by Deltana and is available in a variety of finishes from brass tones to sliver. The Modern 7 Inch Heavy Duty Kickdown Holder comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-kickdown-door-stop-deltana-dhk4\"><b>4 Inch Kickdown</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/5-inch-kickdown-door-stop-deltana-dhk5\"><b>5 Inch Kickdown</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-kickdown-door-holder-deltana-del-dhk-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Extra Long 7\" Kickdown Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Out-swing Projection: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Gap to Floor: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DHK07-specifications.pdf?v=1691095349\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DHK7 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
